# --- Porting-phase scaffolding -------------------------------------------
# A copy of the SSG dashboard repo, kept only while the reconciliation logic
# is being ported. Never commit it: it can carry buyer PII and account data.
# Must stay in sync with .dockerignore — .gitignore alone does not stop a
# broad `COPY . .` from baking it into an image layer.
reference/

# Captured provider snapshots used by the parity harness. These contain real
# order and transaction data, including buyer PII.
snapshots/
testdata/parity/*/input/

# --- Local-only project notes ---------------------------------------------
# CLAUDE.md is Claude Code's project-memory file: internal working notes for
# an AI coding assistant, not meant for a public audience.
#
# docs/PARITY.md is the porting-phase ledger comparing this service against
# the legacy reconciliation script it replaces. It is temporary by design —
# deleted once that migration is complete — and references the other
# codebase's internal file structure, so it stays local-only rather than
# committed as permanent documentation.
#
# The rest of docs/ is public-facing supporting documentation and IS tracked.
CLAUDE.md
docs/PARITY.md

